WEBVTT

00:06:30.000 --> 00:06:34.250
largely unaltered, deep-frozen,
awaiting the chemists from Earth."

00:06:35.708 --> 00:06:37.976
We are those chemists.

00:06:38.000 --> 00:06:41.184
Dragonfly is a search
for greater understanding,

00:06:41.208 --> 00:06:44.809
not just of Titan and the mysteries
of our solar system,

00:06:44.833 --> 00:06:46.458
but of our own origins.

00:06:47.167 --> 00:06:48.458
Thank you.